nLooking at the PRD requirements:\\n\\n**Button Component - Requirements Check:**\\n- [x] Hover lift effect (`hover:-translate-y-0.5`)\\n- [x] Colored shadow on hover\\n- [x] Active state (`active:translate-y-0 active:shadow-sm`)\\n- [x] Transition timing (`duration-200`)\\n- [x] All variants updated\\n\\n**Card Component - Requirements Check:**\\n- [x] Card component exists\\n- [x] Size variants (small, medium, large, full)\\n- [x] Height variants (short, default, tall)\\n- [x] Hover effect (border glow, lift, shadow)\\n- [x] Optional gradient background\\n- [x] Subcomponents (CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription, CardContent, CardFooter)\\n- [x] Uses design system colors and spacing\\n- [x] Uses serif font for CardTitle\\n\\n**Sidebar Component - Requirements Check:**\\n- [x] Uses updated color scheme\\n- [x] Navigation items have smooth hover animation\\n- [x] Active item has visible indicator (left border)\\n- [x] Logo area uses brand styling\\n- [x] Serif font for brand name\\n\\nLet me also verify there are no issues with the Card component's padding structure. Looking at the Card component, the padding is applied inside a nested div with `p-6`, but this structure might cause issues when used without the gradient option - the outer div would have no padding. Let me check if this is correct.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2201,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":62191,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":2201,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":1}},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"a676d0f4-539d-4f02-a509-ac08d0e9ca75\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-01T17:30:57.262Z\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"a676d0f4-539d-4f02-a509-ac08d0e9ca75\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/lxy/Documents/GitHub/LinXueyuanStdio/trellis-worktrees/feature/design-system-phase2\",\"sessionId\":\"c2b02e46-ae63-4a2f-9916-047890d24a25\",\"version\":\"2.1.22\",\"gitBranch\":\"fe